  "instructions_by_domain": {
    "travel": "Track intent and persistent preferences. Context is all user messages, API history plus new_message, or previous_beliefs plus new_message; treat them equivalently. Intent: book_flight (find or book a flight); book_hotel (find or book a hotel); unknown (another request). Return intent probabilities summing to 1 and independent probabilities for budget_sensitive (the traveler currently prioritizes low prices); prefers_direct (the traveler currently prefers nonstop flights). Keep intent across task follow-ups and preference/constraint/permission updates, even without a task verb. Switch for a new task. Use unknown for unrelated requests or explicit pause/cancellation. Preferences persist across tasks; latest explicit changes, negations and reversals win. Use supplied context only. Return schema JSON.",
    "shopping": "Track intent and persistent preferences. Context is all user messages, API history plus new_message, or previous_beliefs plus new_message; treat them equivalently. Intent: shop_phone (choose or buy a phone); shop_laptop (choose or buy a laptop); unknown (another request). Return intent probabilities summing to 1 and independent probabilities for budget_sensitive (the buyer currently prioritizes low prices); prefers_new (the buyer currently requires a new, not used or refurbished, device). Keep intent across task follow-ups and preference/constraint/permission updates, even without a task verb. Switch for a new task. Use unknown for unrelated requests or explicit pause/cancellation. Preferences persist across tasks; latest explicit changes, negations and reversals win. Use supplied context only. Return schema JSON.",
    "support": "Track intent and persistent preferences. Context is all user messages, API history plus new_message, or previous_beliefs plus new_message; treat them equivalently. Intent: debug_api (troubleshoot an API/service); debug_database (troubleshoot a database/query); unknown (another request). Return intent probabilities summing to 1 and independent probabilities for urgent (the incident currently requires urgent handling); allow_restart (the user currently permits a service restart as a remedial action). Keep intent across task follow-ups and preference/constraint/permission updates, even without a task verb. Switch for a new task. Use unknown for unrelated requests or explicit pause/cancellation. Preferences persist across tasks; latest explicit changes, negations and reversals win. Use supplied context only. Return schema JSON.",
    "planning": "Track intent and persistent preferences. Context is all user messages, API history plus new_message, or previous_beliefs plus new_message; treat them equivalently. Intent: schedule_meeting (schedule or reschedule a meeting); prepare_report (prepare or revise a report); unknown (another request). Return intent probabilities summing to 1 and independent probabilities for deadline_flexible (the deadline can currently move); delegate_ok (the user currently permits delegating work to teammates). Keep intent across task follow-ups and preference/constraint/permission updates, even without a task verb. Switch for a new task. Use unknown for unrelated requests or explicit pause/cancellation. Preferences persist across tasks; latest explicit changes, negations and reversals win. Use supplied context only. Return schema JSON.",
    "writing": "Track intent and persistent preferences. Context is all user messages, API history plus new_message, or previous_beliefs plus new_message; treat them equivalently. Intent: draft_email (draft an email); draft_message (draft a chat/direct message); unknown (another request). Return intent probabilities summing to 1 and independent probabilities for concise (the user currently prefers concise writing); formal (the user currently prefers formal tone). Keep intent across task follow-ups and preference/constraint/permission updates, even without a task verb. Switch for a new task. Use unknown for unrelated requests or explicit pause/cancellation. Preferences persist across tasks; latest explicit changes, negations and reversals win. Use supplied context only. Return schema JSON."
  },
  "methodology": "Synthetic labeled conversations; identical domain instructions/schema across paths. Full history resends user messages only; provider history retains model outputs too. Snapshot sends only BeliefRuntime state and latest message. Every creation/update call counted. Latency includes response body, parsing and runtime infer merge, excludes local snapshot load/save and report writes. Serial calls, rotating workflow order, no retries, 120s request timeout. Cache reads/writes are disjoint subsets of input; absent cache fields treated as zero. Cost uses explicit supplied rates only; excludes storage, serialization, taxes and failed/unreported calls. Partial reports must not be used for workflow comparisons.",
